# The source checkouts and downloads are reproducible from the fetch scripts.
# public/corpus/ is NOT ignored: it is what the site serves, 45 MiB of it, and
# committing it keeps the deploy a pure build with no network and no 220 MB
# clone of someone else's repo. Rebuild it with `bun run corpus`.
/.cache

